<title>UK: Sigma Finance sets $400 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sigma Finance sets $400 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Salomon Brothers International and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    30.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.445   PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.82     SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/CAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.MAR.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
